    "body": "Doing this as WebIDL types makes a lot of sense to me, at which point this issue isn't in the right repository. We'll need 4 types: {Instant, Duration} x {allow numbers (legacy), disallow numbers}. I think we can avoid the clock distinctions, but we can discuss that in the WebIDL issue.",
