    "body": "> I don't think it can work for all of them since not all of them are for epoch times. But maybe we should make separate types for epoch and relative and let it all flow from there.\n> \n> cc [@yoavweiss](https://github.com/yoavweiss)\n\nHow do we envision this working for relative/monotonic timestamps? It would assume that the global object's `timeOrigin` is the relevant one here?",
