    "updated_at": "2025-07-15T13:10:03Z",
    "body": "If we want two types of expiry, an absolute timestamp and a relative number, could just supporting a maxAge attr as proposed in https://github.com/WICG/cookie-store/issues/57 solve this instead of creating a new option?  ",
