    "created_at": "2025-07-15T13:46:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-07-15T13:46:08Z",
    "body": "I think `Temporal` integration we should attempt to tackle web-platform wide at the IDL level. By creating a type for since-epoch, a type for monotonic, and a type for a duration. We would use since-epoch for `expires` and ideally IDL would handle the rest.\n\nSupporting `maxAge` would be good I think as it's part of cookies, but it's largely orthogonal to this issue. (There is some overlap in that it would probably want the duration type.)",
